      "value": "That sensitivity thing should be all the way to the left if you want to allow your voice to come through easily and should only be far to the right if you want to mute yourself basically. It's basically a gate for when people can start hearing you. I have mine down at 1% for desktop mode and 5% in vr. Hope this helps.",
